Business Problem

QuickBite wants to launch an online food delivery platform where customers can order food from nearby restaurants.
The first version is a console-based application built in Core Java.
The focus is on clean OOP design, not UI.

   👥 Actors

   There are three types of users.

   1. Customer

   A customer can browse restaurants, order food, pay, and track orders.

   2. Restaurant Owner

   A restaurant owner manages their menu and receives customer orders.

   3. Admin

   Admin manages the platform, restaurants, and user
